  "maxhub-ym53-series": {"sections":[],"datasheet":"","overview":"MAXHUB focuses on developing collaboration solutions that enable immersive communications. We have enhanced team creativity and productivity worldwide by providing advanced audio-visual technologies and one-stop solutions.","features":["CHANGE LOCATION","MAXHUB’s Designed for Outdoors","Outdoor LED","The Future of Display Technology","YM53 Outdoor LED","Dedicated Outdoor Display","Efficient & Power Saving","Slim and Lightweight","Amazing 3840Hz Refresh Rate","All-in-one Power Box Design","P4/P6/P10mm pixel pitch","Built for Outdoor Use","Slim & Light","Keep It Cool"],"paras":["MAXHUB’s YM53 Outdoor LED is the perfect exterior digital signage solution. Lightweight design is easy to deploy and features increased energy efficiency and heat resistance. Outstanding 3840 ultra-high refresh rate for crystal clear picture. The all-in-one power box is ready to go on day one with simple, easy install.","Helping to minimize environmental impact by reducing waste, conserving resources, and adopting sustainable manufacturing methods.","Cabinet features a reduced steel structure thats just 2.6 inches thick and weighs just 45lbs","20bit color depth, 15000:1 high contrast and 10000cd/㎡ brightness produce outstanding displays even under strong direct sunlight","Highly-integrated design with reduced wiring, closely fitted components, and effective heat dissipation for long-term outdoor use.","Versatile pixel pitch options ensures optimal image quality for various viewing distances."]},
  "maxhub-led-solutions": {"sections":[],"datasheet":"","overview":"MAXHUB focuses on developing collaboration solutions that enable immersive communications. We have enhanced team creativity and productivity worldwide by providing advanced audio-visual technologies and one-stop solutions.","features":["CHANGE LOCATION","DIRECT VIEW LED SOLUTIONS","SOLUTIONS FOR LED DISPLAY","MALL EXTERNAL 3D DISPLAY","RETAIL DISPLAY","CONTROL CENTER","LARGE CONFERENCE / TRAINING ROOM","LECTURE HALL / AMPHITHEATER CLASSROOM","CUSTOMER STORIES","DESIGN YOUR DISPLAY","GET CONNECTED WITH US","INTERNATIONAL","ASIA & PACIFIC","Solutions"],"paras":["Display products are an important part of the MAXHUB product family. Therefore, we have introduced LED display products that can be used in multiple scenarios. They inherit the characteristics of MAXHUB products, such as easy deployment, easy operation, and easy maintenance which bring users an amazing display experience.","Experience the stunning, energy-efficient right-angle 3D product, easy to install with comprehensive maintenance.","The product delivers superior image quality, dual backup to prevent black screens, presents 3D effects, and its refresh and scan rates meet shooting requirements.","This entry-level, small-pitch product can be wall-mounted to save space and allows for screen layout adjustment via a controller.","High-definition large screen composed of engineering screens, supports multi-window display with Nova system and ensures data security with dual backup.","In the context of large conference rooms, the integrated MAXHUB product simplifies installation, its built-in system supports screen sharing, and it is compatible with central control."]},
  "maxhub-led-configurator": {"sections":[],"datasheet":"","overview":"MAXHUB focuses on developing collaboration solutions that enable immersive communications. We have enhanced team creativity and productivity worldwide by providing advanced audio-visual technologies and one-stop solutions.","features":["CHANGE LOCATION","SPECIFICATIONS","GET CONNECTED WITH US","EXPORT LED CONFIGURATOR","Product Model Selection","Viewing Distance table","{$ modelName $}","INTERNATIONAL","ASIA & PACIFIC","Solutions","Partner Portal","MAXHUB LED CONFIGURATOR How to start","News & Events","Customer Stories"],"paras":["* Specifications are subject to change without notice.","* The configuration information in this document is for simulated installation only, while actual physical specifications may vary.","Please consult with MAXHUB or your installation partner for accurate information.","For a better browsing experience, please use desktop computer to access.","This table is highlighting minimum and optimal viewing distances for custom LED wall"]},
