  "maxhub-uc-w31": {"sections":[],"datasheet":"","overview":"MAXHUB focuses on developing collaboration solutions that enable immersive communications. We have enhanced team creativity and productivity worldwide by providing advanced audio-visual technologies and one-stop solutions.","features":["CHANGE LOCATION","Camera Parameters","Image Sensor","Output Resolution","Field of View","Touch Point","Digital Noise Reduction","Output Format","White Balance","USB-C 3.0 (Device)","Accessories","USB Cable (USB-C to USB-A, 1.8m/5.9 feet)","Hand-tightened Screw","Solution Overview"]},
  "maxhub-uc-bm35": {"sections":[],"datasheet":"","overview":"MAXHUB focuses on developing collaboration solutions that enable immersive communications. We have enhanced team creativity and productivity worldwide by providing advanced audio-visual technologies and one-stop solutions.","features":["CHANGE LOCATION","GET CONNECTED WITH US","INTERNATIONAL","ASIA & PACIFIC","Solutions","Partner Portal","News & Events","Customer Stories"],"paras":["Portability and practicality combine in a powerful audio device built for better meetings. The BM35 bluetooth teleconference speakerphone is optimized to keep human voices clear, capturing every utterance in perfect detail and ensuring an exceptional listening experiences.","Portability and practicality come together in a powerful audio device, built for better meetings. The BM35 is optimized to keep human voices clear. Capturing every utterance in perfect detail, the BM35 empowers any team. Hi-Fi sound quality also ensures exceptional listening experiences when playing music or videos.","The BM35 is proof that big things really can come in small packages. This compact powerhouse combines exceptional immersive sound.","360° omnidirectional audio algorithms capture voices up to 6 meters away, so everyone in your meeting can make their voices heard.","A powerful 8-microphone array gives depth to conversations, ensuring every detail comes through loud and clear.","State-of-the-art reverberation suppression keeps unnecessary distractions to an absolute minimum. Even in glass meeting rooms, the BM35 will intelligently absorb echo and localize the sound to keep the attention on your people. Supported by AI noise cancellation and AEC, the BM35 filters through the noise to improve focus and enhance collaborative experiences."]},
