  "maxhub-raptor-series-v3": {"sections":[],"datasheet":"","paras":[],"features":["Explore A Range Of Superior Visual Quality Options For Your Room — The options available range from 120\" to 220\", offering versatility to accommodate various room sizes and viewing preferences.","Built-In Android 13 System — Experience more than just a display; with numerous built-in applications, transform your room into a versatile space.","Radar Touch Control — Master your presentations with intuitive radar touch. Highly sensitive and immune to environmental interference, it installs instantly with a wide sensing range. Freely adapt it to any display size for truly seamless interaction."]},
  "maxhub-raptor-series-v3-lite": {"sections":[{"section":"Display","items":[{"label":"SLED Type","value":"LP135V07C: COB · LP135F07: SMD · LP162V12C: COB · LP162F07: SMD"},{"label":"Screen Size","value":"LP135V07C: 135\" · LP135F07: 135\" · LP162V12C: 162\" · LP162F07: 162\""},{"label":"Aspect Ratio","value":"16:9"},{"label":"Resolution","value":"LP135V07C: 1,920 × 1,080 · LP135F07: 1,920 × 1,080 · LP162V12C: 2,304 × 1,296 · LP162F07: 1,920 × 1,080"},{"label":"Brightness (Typ.)","value":"LP135V07C: 600 nits · LP135F07: 550 nits · LP162V12C: 600 nits · LP162F07: 550 nits"},{"label":"Refresh Rate","value":"3,840 Hz"},{"label":"Contrast Ratio (Typ.)","value":"LP135V07C: 15,000:1 · LP135F07: 6,500:1 · LP162V12C: 15,000:1 · LP162F07: 6,500:1"},{"label":"Viewing Angle (H × V)","value":"LP135V07C: 170° / 170° · LP135F07: 160° / 160° · LP162V12C: 170° / 170° · LP162F07: 160° / 160°"}]},{"section":"Built-in System","items":[{"label":"Operating System","value":"Android 13.0"},{"label":"CPU","value":"4 × Cortex-A76 + 4 × Cortex-A55"},{"label":"RAM","value":"4 GB"},{"label":"ROM","value":"64 GB"}]},{"section":"Connectivity","items":[{"label":"HDMI IN","value":"× 2"},{"label":"USB 3.0","value":"× 1"},{"label":"AUDIO OUT","value":"× 1"},{"label":"RS232","value":"× 1"},{"label":"RJ45 IN","value":"× 1"},{"label":"Bluetooth","value":"5.3"}]},{"section":"Feature","items":[{"label":"Screen Share","value":"Screen sharing with wireless dongle / MAXHUB Share"},{"label":"Special Features","value":"Front maintenance and hot swapping / Pivot⁺ Cloud Management"}]},{"section":"Physical Specification","items":[{"label":"Dimension (W × H × D)","value":"LP135V07C: 3,012 × 1,699.5 × 31 mm · LP135F07: 3,012 × 1,699.5 × 31 mm · LP162V12C: 3,612 × 2,037 × 31 mm · LP162F07: 3,612 × 2,037 × 31 mm"},{"label":"Net Weight","value":"LP135V07C: 95 kg · LP135F07: 95 kg · LP162V12C: 126.8 kg · LP162F07: 126.8 kg"}]}],"datasheet":""},
  "maxhub-xbar-u50": {"sections":[],"datasheet":"https://sgp-cstore-pub.maxhub.com/maxhub_global_public/upload/mvj9qrb9/MAXHUB_XBar_Series_Brochure_20261022_v18.pdf","paras":["The MAXHUB XBar U50 is a USB mode dual-camera Videobar designed for small to medium rooms and BYOD scenarios. With 100MP dual cameras, 12 beam-forming microphones, Al-enhanced audio, and FlexMount for easy installation, it offers plug-and-play conferencing without fixed systems for ultimate flexibility."],"features":["Deploy Your Way — Windows, Android, Or USB Simplicity — Supports Windows, Android (MDEP), and USB modes across four models. Ensures secure deployment, seamless third-party compatibility, and enhanced IT management for diverse collaboration needs.","Every Detail, Every Angle — Our sophisticated dual-eye camera system delivers exceptional image quality for meetings, combining 12 high-definition lenses with innovative stitching to achieve 100MP resolution and 2400 TV lines. With its ultra-wide 125° horizontal field of view and advanced technology, it ensures comprehensive coverage and clear video, capturing every detail so users never miss anything critical.","Every Word Made Clear — Featuring 12 intelligent beam-forming microphones with an 8m pickup range and dual 15W speakers equipped with quad bass units, this system delivers precise sound tracking, crystal-clear communication, and rich, balanced audio. It transforms any space into a professional meeting environment with exceptional clarity and immersive sound quality.","Every Voice, Every Corner — Transform your meetings with our advanced 12-microphone beamforming array which precisely tracks voices across the room, ensuring every word is captured with crystal clarity from up to six meters away. Dual 15W speakers, enhanced with quad bass units, deliver rich, balanced, and room-filling sound, creating a truly immersive and connected meeting experience where every voice is heard and every idea resonates.","Flexmount - Flexible Mounting, Fewer Tools, Less Hassle — FlexMount combines sleek design and easy installation for professional, adaptable meeting spaces with minimal hassle.","Flexible Cable Routing — The design includes built-in cable management with exits at the top, bottom, and rear, ensuring a clean and organized setup regardless of mounting position.","3-In-1 Mounting Solution — Designed for wall, desk, or display installation, with adjustable mounting angles for versatile positioning on desktops, above or below TVs, or along sliding rails.​","Status At A Glance — White, green, or red LEDs clearly show if the device is working, busy, or off — cutting out the guesswork.","Peace Of Mind, 3-Year Guaranteed — Enjoy peace of mind knowing your technology is in good hands. MAXHUB’s comprehensive support, including a 3-year warranty and local experts, ensures long-lasting performance and a seamless workflow."]},
